{"3305870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mindwarp: Island Detective", "steam_appid": 3305870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/a664d3a295cd6df0ca1951216aa2319f.avif?t=1774649326\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team are elite detectives who have arrived on an isolated island where something terrible has happened. In &quot;Mindwarp&quot;, time is your main adversary. Can you unravel the intricate web of lies and clues before the clock strikes midnight?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigation Preparation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/7e395841012b7d1b8bccd6fe7f77c3cb.avif?t=1774649326\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Team </strong>: In the menu, gather your team of detectives (play solo or team up with friends in co-op, or perhaps you'll want to compete with friends for the title of best detective!).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario</strong>: Customize your game mode and set off for the island, receiving a brief introduction to the case.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/6a37030845cf2b1dcb1e39e18ad5babf.avif?t=1774649326\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island World</strong>: Explore a picturesque yet mysterious island, filled with atmospheric locations and hidden corners.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living NPCs</strong>: Interact with the local residents – each has their own unique backstory, daily routine, and a host of secrets. Simply approach them and press a button to <strong>start a dialogue</strong>, ask questions, uncover contradictions, and gain valuable clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clue Hunting</strong>: Thoroughly search the map – from secret notes to suspicious objects, every piece of evidence brings you closer to solving the mystery. Collect them, analyze them, and piece them together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/e9c3bc108729f6ab879542d013f9be9a.avif?t=1774649326\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Time</strong>: You have only one in-game day to gather as much information as possible, interrogate all witnesses, and find key evidence. Time waits for no one!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision Making</strong>: Before dusk, you must deliver your verdict: who committed the crime and how? An incorrect decision will mean failure.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/a664d3a295cd6df0ca1951216aa2319f.avif?t=1774649326\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team are elite detectives who have arrived on an isolated island where something terrible has happened. In &quot;Mindwarp&quot;, time is your main adversary. Can you unravel the intricate web of lies and clues before the clock strikes midnight?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigation Preparation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/7e395841012b7d1b8bccd6fe7f77c3cb.avif?t=1774649326\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Team </strong>: In the menu, gather your team of detectives (play solo or team up with friends in co-op, or perhaps you'll want to compete with friends for the title of best detective!).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario</strong>: Customize your game mode and set off for the island, receiving a brief introduction to the case.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/6a37030845cf2b1dcb1e39e18ad5babf.avif?t=1774649326\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island World</strong>: Explore a picturesque yet mysterious island, filled with atmospheric locations and hidden corners.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living NPCs</strong>: Interact with the local residents – each has their own unique backstory, daily routine, and a host of secrets. Simply approach them and press a button to <strong>start a dialogue</strong>, ask questions, uncover contradictions, and gain valuable clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clue Hunting</strong>: Thoroughly search the map – from secret notes to suspicious objects, every piece of evidence brings you closer to solving the mystery. Collect them, analyze them, and piece them together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/e9c3bc108729f6ab879542d013f9be9a.avif?t=1774649326\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Time</strong>: You have only one in-game day to gather as much information as possible, interrogate all witnesses, and find key evidence. Time waits for no one!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision Making</strong>: Before dusk, you must deliver your verdict: who committed the crime and how? An incorrect decision will mean failure.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Up to 4 players in online co-op. Talk to characters, learn their stories, search for clues and pass judgment before sunset in this unique detective.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/71f848ef83e74ff5d25ffcb8ab658d586f6a5f6d/header.jpg?t=1774649326", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/09b7b2ad430b237d45cc304b67b5cdbea9280e57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774649326", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/09b7b2ad430b237d45cc304b67b5cdbea9280e57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774649326", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul 